      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEY MICKEY (6) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 22.45 beating Sparky Key. Jumping from the pinch draw but likes the trip. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. TRICKLE (1) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fourth (23.08) at The Gardens latest. Solid record here winning two races. The form out of his last race has been franked. Leading chance. HANK MCCOY (2) finished well back at this track last time when a 12 length sixth (22.88) but scored five back at The Gardens (22.99). Form here at the trip excellent including two wins. Comes through a solid form race last start. Should be in this for a long way. HIT THE POST (8) can run a bold race on best form.",
